OL,3,ATrump says 'largely true' Iran war to
OL,4,Ablame for Republican midterm losses but
OL,5,Ahe would 'do it again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says it's "largely true"
OL,8,Fthe Iran war is to blame for his
OL,9,FRepublican Party's US midterm losses,
OL,10,Fin his first on-camera comments since
OL,11,Fthe results
OL,13,F"But at the same time if I had to do it
OL,14,Fagain, I'd have to do it again," the
OL,15,Fpresident adds - here's what else we
OL,16,Fheard
OL,18,FEarlier, Vice-President JD Vance
OL,19,Freleased a lengthy statement, saying
OL,20,F"the reason we lost is the war" - our
OL,21,FWashington correspondent called it an
OL,22,Funusually candid assessment
