OL,5,Ahe would 'do it again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats won the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in the elections, taking control
OL,9,Fof Congress for the rest of Trump's
OL,10,Fpresidency
OL,12,FIn Senate races, Democrats picked up a
OL,13,Fstring of victories in Republican
OL,14,Fstrongholds. Two are yet to be called -
OL,15,Fin Alaska the process could take weeks
OL,16,Fwhile in Mississippi, more than 95% of
OL,17,Fthe votes have been counted
